<view class="page petstats-page"><view class="page-title">社区里的毛孩子。</view><view class="subtitle">只看登记概况，帮助安排更合适的话题与活动。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在汇总宠物资料…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!isAdmin}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">仅运营者可以查看</view><view class="muted">这里展示账号登记资料的汇总统计。</view></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo-label">本机体验 · 仅统计当前设备记录</view><view class="summary-grid"><view class="summary-card"><text class="summary-number">{{stats.totalUsers}}</text><text>账号总数</text></view><view class="summary-card"><text class="summary-number">{{stats.profilesWithPet}}</text><text>已填写宠物的账号</text></view><view class="summary-card"><text class="summary-number">{{stats.profilesWithoutPet}}</text><text>未填写宠物的账号</text></view><view class="summary-card"><text class="summary-number">{{stats.publicPetProfiles}}</text><text>在头像旁展示宠物的账号</text></view></view><view class="card types-card"><view class="section-title">首只登记宠物的类型</view><view wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="id" class="type-stat"><view class="row between"><text>{{item.icon}} {{item.name}}</text><text class="type-count">{{item.count}} 份 · {{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="type-track"><view class="type-progress" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{stats.profilesWithPet === 0}}" class="no-pets">还没有账号填写宠物资料。</view></view><view class="scope-note">{{stats.scope}}</view><view class="privacy-note">此页不展示逐人资料或提供私密记录导出。“头像旁展示”统计仅包含主动开启头像旁展示的账号，不包含仅公开到主页的资料。</view></block></view>
